--- ===== 044_mission_flow_hardening.sql =====
--- ============================================================================
--- 12 Tester — Supabase migration 044: Hardening luồng Nhiệm vụ App
--- (M02, M03, M05, M06, M07)
--- ============================================================================
-
--- ============================================================================
--- 1. Bảng outbox / settlement jobs cho trả thưởng nhiệm vụ (M05)
